title: "ARA"
abstract: >-
  ARA, the Ant-Colony-Based Routing Algorithm (Güneş, Sorges & Bouazizi,
  2002), as a standalone swarm routing protocol for MANETs: a
  simulator-agnostic C++ core and an ns-3 contrib module on swarm-core, with a
  paper-fidelity sheet.
